  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR support to SS refugees in WN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to meet WASH needs for the South Sudanese refugees in White Nile state in Elsalam and Eljabalain localities, in collaboration with MOH, SRC, WES, UNHCR UNICEF and HAC. All activities in this response are within the Sudan Refugee response plan and the WASH strategy which is under development. The design of this project has also considered the JAM recommendations, JAM is conducted in late November 2016 in all refugee&#x2019;s sites in WN by different agencies CAFOD has also been involved in the exercise.</narrative>
  </description>
